    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d936-a1">

                <pb facs="1089" n="993" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg993"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to the Marquis of Salisbury.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-07-19"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to acquaint your
                    lordship that my Government desires to arrive at an understanding with that of
                    Spain in respect to the neutrality both on the inward and outward voyage of the
                    transports in which the troops that surrendered at Santiago de Cuba are to be
                    returned to Spain, and I am instructed to express the hope that Her Majesty’s
                    Government will be so good as to allow Her Majesty’s ambassador at Madrid to act
                    as intermediary in the matter.</p>
                <p>My Government would like it understood that no belligerent act is to be committed
                    by or upon these transports, and that they will not be subjected to any port
                    charges in Spain except pilotage.</p>
                <p>I shall be much obliged if your lordship will have the goodness to cause the
                    views of the Spanish Government in this matter to be ascertained with the least
                    possible delay.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
